    <briefdescription>
<para>Mapping from <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_variable" kindref="compound">DebugVariable</ref> to/from a unique identifying number. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_variable" kindref="compound">DebugVariable</ref> consists of three pointers, and after a small amount of work to identify overlapping fragments of variables we mostly only use DebugVariables as identities of variables. It&apos;s much more compile-time efficient to use an <ref refid="namespacellvm_1_1_calling_conv_1abdf8cf606905c10634e831390981b0ed" kindref="member">ID</ref> number instead, which this class provides. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
